his knowledge comes with a heavy price and the Solipsist must guard his thoughts, lest he come to believe that the world exists only within his own mind.","source_tag":"_t","target":"使用此理论需要付出巨大的代价，织梦者必须对自己的思维有很强的控制力，否则他会渐渐相信这世界只存在于他自己的心智之中。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1c541730a50e110e7b26786ca206374b2b75a4db81d982fc87d1519ec4a49dbc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6a94b4d267fa6645600ea96acb04b350c0a2da893bcb2c121c52d6fa6139eba3","logical_entry_identity":"d6aba5e24a52d9d78475d1ed18a3b6c7ce9c68164d6dd0cb89e655efa91a0162","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Use telekinetic forces to greatly augment the durability and tension of your bow in order to fire an arrow with velocity unmatched by even the mightiest mundane archers. Increases armor penetration by %d, and deals %d%% damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使用精神灵能以增强弓的耐久和张力，使射出的箭矢拥有连最强大的普通弓手都无法企及的飞行速度。增加 %d 点护甲穿透并造成 %d%% 伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be95eaf93cbb46a0dc891dfa256c8f4493c752e8f4c0f26096a045826468fb5c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6d66b65c43acc3d453dddc93784bc59219b4c177efe81b8c3959e71123b09879","logical_entry_identity":"0d0ad917c76ca5f3a91c5ac7cb08fb481351403db3537ea6724d1e19e422415c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and left to rot","source_tag":"_t","target":"并任其腐烂"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"26381bf88d70f31085a38811d8c4dee4c7955592680679d5bf8dba6eec5d7f93","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9d7bf14dfb3ab7a5d87acece723bbe3ee780c9ca1ed42f53b5c87f0f41e623c1","logical_entry_identity":"791f387fc21e0a7490815088bc618f9292cbaedfd6a5036000c08c56f96eb377","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have expended the power of your Radiance temporarily reducing its radius to 1.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你消耗了光辉之力，暂时把光照半径降低到 1 码。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1248372f3ba9e91b910c2a8b08ff1111faa0ff7bd05302fff658db7bd8439e9c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"adf26e50833c3ee3810e5d574813af318e9